d)] sm:text-2xl\",\"children\":\"A new video tokenizer brings Shannon's information theory to robotics data — spending tokens only where content is unpredictable. This yields a pricing revolution: data billed by information content, not by the hour. Rare, surprising moments cost more and are worth more.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 text-[14px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--primary)]/40 bg-[var(--primary)]/10 font-heading text-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":\"DR\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold\",\"children\":\"DigiRobotics Team\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"Updated \",\"November 20, 2026\"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-[170px_minmax(0,760px)] lg:justify-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden lg:block\",\"children\":\"$L5\"}],\"$L6\"]}]]}],\"$L7\"]}],null,\"$L8\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@9\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lb\",\"isPartial\":\"$@c\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Ld\",\"isPartial\":\"$@e\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":\"$f\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L10\",\"isPartial\":\"$@11\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":\"$f\"}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@12\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@13\"}\n24:I[38437,[\"99489\",\"static/chunks/99489-7b4b74c1a59849db.js\",\"5772\",\"static/chunks/5772-2ad3d6bb0136fa62.js\",\"57304\",\"static/chunks/57304-ca98254065b92130.js\",\"95953\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-a38ec015cb873e3f.js\"],\"Image\"]\n29:I[90484,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n2a:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n2c:I[90484,[],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n2d:I[90484,[],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n2e:I[86869,[],\"IconMark\"]\n2f:I[57121,[],\"\"]\n30:I[74581,[],\"\"]\n5:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-28 border-t border-[var(--primary)] pt-4 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase leading-5 tracking-[0.15em] text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"DigiRobotics\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"Field note\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"2026.11.20\"]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"blockquote\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-10 border-l-2 border-[var(--primary)] bg-[var(--primary)]/[0.06] px-6 py-2 font-heading text-xl leading-8 text-white sm:px-8\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"TL;DR:\"}]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"A new peer-reviewed video tokenizer brings Shannon's information theory to robotics data: it spends tokens only where content is unpredictable — robot arms, moving hands, complex action — and almost none on static backgrounds. The math is general: resources should follow information density, whether the medium is pixels, audio, or attention. Social media teams already run the same equation: analyze, find gaps, allocate effort where audiences engage, starve what is predictable. For robotics data markets, this yields a pricing revolution: data billed by information content, not by the hour — rare, surprising moments cost more and are worth more. DigiRobotics is building adaptive tokenization into its marketplace, so contributors get paid for what teaches, and agents pay only for what they don't already know.\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Spend Tokens Where Pixels Surprise\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Modern physical AI models consume video as tokens — video is compressed into sequences of discrete symbols that generative models can learn from. But today's standard tokenizers are wasteful: they chop every frame into a uniform grid and spend the same budget on a static wall as on a robot hand mid-grasp. A fixed surveillance feed and a crowded street get identical treatment.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"A newly recognized research framework fixes this with information theory. Its principle is pure Shannon: the more predictable something is, the fewer bits it deserves. Its implementation is elegant: an ELBO-based router estimates how \\\"surprising\\\" each video is and assigns it a token budget accordingly. An adaptive compressor encodes the content into that variable-length budget. And the whole system runs as a plug-in on existing industry tokenizers, faster than prior heuristic approaches.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The results are striking: it saves roughly a fifth of tokens with no quality loss, and achieves over double the compression while beating heuristic adaptive methods on every quality metric. Watch its token masks and the behavior is intuitive: on robot manipulation footage, the arm and the object light up while the tabletop stays dark; in egocentric biking footage, tokens spread evenly because everything moves.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Attention Markets Run the Same Math\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Now step into a completely different industry: social media content. The professional playbook for social content prescribes, in essence, the same algorithm. Research audience density — personas, listening tools, and engagement analytics reveal where attention actually concentrates. Find information gaps — what is the audience asking that nobody is answering? Those unanswered questions are high-entropy: rare, in-demand, and disproportionately valuable. Format-fit the channel — short-form video where discovery happens, long-form where authority compounds; identical content deployed identically everywhere is the fixed-rate tokenizer of marketing. Measure and reallocate — double down on formats and topics that drive measurable engagement; starve what performs like a static background. And automate the repetitive — AI-assisted drafting, scheduling, and optimization free human effort for the creative, surprising work that actually earns attention.\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L14\",\"\\n\",\"$L15\",\"\\n\",\"$L16\",\"\\n\",\"$L17\",\"\\n\",\"$L18\",\"\\n\",\"$L19\",\"\\n\",\"$L1a\",\"\\n\",\"$L1b\",\"\\n\",\"$L1c\",\"\\n\",\"$L1d\",\"\\n\",\"$L1e\",\"\\n\",\"$L1f\",\"\\n\",\"$L20\",\"\\n\",\"$L21\",\"\\n\",\"$L22\"],\"$L23\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/[.08] bg-[#111620] py-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L24\",null,{\"src\":\"/digirobotics/brand/digirobotics-logo.png\",\"alt\":\"DigiRobotics.xyz\",\"width\":210,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-auto w-[190px]\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-[17px] text-white/60\",\"children\":\"Egocentric data for robotics training.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Footer navigation\",\"className\":\"flex max-w-2xl flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contributor\",{\"href\":\"/#contributors\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contributor\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Marketplace\",{\"href\":\"/#marketplace\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Marketplace\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Custom Data\",{\"href\":\"/#custom-data\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Custom Data\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Capture Gear\",{\"href\":\"/gear\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Capture Gear\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Articles\",{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Articles\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Agent Demo\",{\"href\":\"/agent-demo\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Agent Demo\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Privacy & Terms\",{\"href\":\"/#privacy-note\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Privacy & Terms\"}],\"$L25\"]}]]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2a\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@2b\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2c\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2a\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Pay for Pixels That Surprise the Machine — DigiRobotics\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"A new video tokenizer brings Shannon's information theory to robotics data — spending tokens only where content is unpredictable. This yields a pricing revolution: data billed by information content, not by the hour. Rare, surprising moments cost more and are worth more.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.webmanifest\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/pay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Pay for Pixels That Surprise the Machine\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"A new video tokenizer brings Shannon's information theory to robotics data — spending tokens only where content is unpredictable. This yields a pricing revolution: data billed by information content, not by the hour. Rare, surprising moments cost more and are worth more.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/pay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/pay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Pay for Pixels That Surprise the Machine\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2026-11-20\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"article:modified_time\",\"content\":\"2026-11-20\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"article:author\",\"content\":\"DigiRobotics Team\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Pay for Pixels That Surprise the Machine\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"A new video tokenizer brings Shannon's information theory to robotics data — spending tokens only where content is unpredictable. This yields a pricing revolution: data billed by information content, not by the hour. Rare, surprising moments cost more and are worth more.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/pay-for-pixels-that-surprise-the-machine-cover.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"17\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?63d5b2ef705d808e\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"19\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2e\",\"20\",{}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L30\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L30\",null,{}]}]]}]\n13:true\n14:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Marketers learned this the hard way, one analytics dashboard at a time: pouring equal effort into every platform, format, and post is the fastest route to mediocrity. The teams that win allocate adaptively.\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"One law governs both worlds: scarce resources — tokens, effort, budget — should flow to wherever the information actually is.\"}]\n16:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Price Data by How Much It Teaches\"}]\n17:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"For the robotics data market, this convergence is about to change how experience is priced. Today, robotics datasets are typically sold by blunt units: hours of footage, number of trajectories, gigabytes of video. Information theory says those units are wrong. An hour of uneventful surveillance in an unchanged warehouse carries a tiny fraction of the learning value of thirty seconds in which a worker improvises a solution to an unseen problem.\"}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Adaptive tokenization makes the difference measurable, and therefore sellable. Entropy-priced captures mean clips tokenized adaptively, with the token count serving as a transparent proxy for information density; rare, surprising footage commands a premium, precisely because it is what models need most. Fidelity flexible by use means the same capture can be delivered at multiple compression levels: coarse tokens for world-model pretraining, full-fidelity for fine-grained dexterity learning, each tier priced accordingly. What machines already know costs less — predictable, redundant content such as the thousandth identical shelf-stocking clip prices toward zero; novel failure modes, unusual tools, unexpected recoveries price high. And contributor incentives go up, not down — this is not a race to cheap data. The contributors who encounter genuine variety — new environments, real anomalies, contact-rich work — earn the most, exactly as intuition says they should.\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The marketplace stops trading storage and starts trading teaching value — the first data market where the price tag reflects how much a moment actually has to say.\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"One Compression Principle, Two Economies\"}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The deep synthesis: tokenization economics and attention economics are the same discipline — adaptive allocation under scarcity, grounded in information theory. Video tokenizers route capacity toward surprising pixels. Media strategists route effort toward surprising questions. Data markets of the next decade will route payment toward surprising experience.\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Every economy built on information — which now includes the physical world as captured by wearables, robots, and sensors — inherits the same design rule: waste nothing on the predictable, and pay well for the rare.\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-4\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"How DigiRobotics Is Building the Future\"}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"DigiRobotics is building this principle into the marketplace core. Adaptive tokenization pipelines compress egocentric video, motion, and sensor streams with information-theoretic routing, so quality concentrates where content is complex. Information-priced listings price captures by information density and rarity, assuring contributors that originality — not volume — wins. Fidelity-tier delivery serves the same capture at multiple compression levels, matched to each buyer's training goal and budget. Stablecoin-native settlement provides micro and streaming payments that make per-token, per-segment commerce economically trivial. And analytics for contributors show which environments and tasks generate high-information demand, so the human supply side can allocate its effort adaptively too.\"}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Machines compress the world by information. DigiRobotics prices it the same way.\"}]\n20:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-5\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Start Building With Us\"}]\n21:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-13\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"If you capture real-world work, train physical AI, or deploy agents that need to learn fast — the entropy market is open.\"}]\n22:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-14\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Connect with DigiRobotics to supply, license, or build on the information-priced marketplace for robotics experience.\"}]\n23:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold transition hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":\"$0:data:0:rsc:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:icon\",\"size\":16,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\" Return to the archive\"]}]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contact Us\",{\"href\":\"mailto:hello@digirobotics.xyz\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contact Us\"}]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"privacy-note\",\"className\":\"mt-10 grid gap-4 border-t border-white/[.08] pt-6 text-[13px] leading-5 text-white/45 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Privacy and terms notices will be published before campaign enrollment or data collection begins. Contact the team for Phase 1 information.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"© 2026 DigiRobotics\"}]]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-white/45\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"x\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M18 6 6 18\",\"key\":\"1bl5f8\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m6 6 12 12\",\"key\":\"d8bk6v\"}]]},\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"mail\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\",\"key\":\"132q7q\"}],[\"rect\",{\"x\":\"2\",\"y\":\"4\",\"width\":\"20\",\"height\":\"16\",\"rx\":\"2\",\"key\":\"izxlao\"}]]},\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white/35\",\"children\":\"Agent-compatible payment workflows powered by stablecoins and x402. Phase 1 infrastructure.\"}]\n2b:null\na:300\na:C\n12:0\nc:\"$undefined\"\ne:\"$undefined\"\n11:\"$undefined\"\n9:\"$undefined\"\n"}}